From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:54:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 27/32] drm/panel: nt36536: add 50 and 48 Hz modes for the
 iceland panel

The stock software switches the OnePlus Pad 4 panel to 50 and 48 Hz for
25 / 50 fps and 24 fps video. Add both rates, derived from our 90 Hz
timing by stretching the vertical front porch at the same pixel clock,
the rule the 60 and 30 Hz modes already follow for the 120 Hz timing:
vtotal = 2480 * 90 / rate, so a vertical front porch of 2010 lines at
50 Hz and 2196 at 48 Hz.

The values match SuperTurtleDev / Yibo Wang's commit 2fe9301e73fa,
which took them from the vendor DFPS lists; that commit was used as a
cross-check only. The 144 Hz mode stays.

Based-on: SuperTurtleDev iceland kernel 2fe9301e73fa (Yibo Wang; mode values cross-checked only)
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36536.c | 24 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 24 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36536.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36536.c
index 61f0c2621bfd..458e899d23b3 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36536.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36536.c
@@ -853,6 +853,30 @@ static const struct drm_display_mode csot_iceland_modes[] = {
 		.vsync_end = 2400 + 2726 + 2,
 		.vtotal = 2400 + 2726 + 2 + 272,
 	},
+	{
+		/* 50Hz: the 90 Hz timing, vertical front porch 2010 (same pixel clock) */
+		.clock = (3392 + 420 + 160 + 320) * (2400 + 2010 + 2 + 52) * 50 / 1000,
+		.hdisplay = 3392,
+		.hsync_start = 3392 + 420,
+		.hsync_end = 3392 + 420 + 160,
+		.htotal = 3392 + 420 + 160 + 320,
+		.vdisplay = 2400,
+		.vsync_start = 2400 + 2010,
+		.vsync_end = 2400 + 2010 + 2,
+		.vtotal = 2400 + 2010 + 2 + 52,
+	},
+	{
+		/* 48Hz: the 90 Hz timing, vertical front porch 2196 (same pixel clock) */
+		.clock = (3392 + 420 + 160 + 320) * (2400 + 2196 + 2 + 52) * 48 / 1000,
+		.hdisplay = 3392,
+		.hsync_start = 3392 + 420,
+		.hsync_end = 3392 + 420 + 160,
+		.htotal = 3392 + 420 + 160 + 320,
+		.vdisplay = 2400,
+		.vsync_start = 2400 + 2196,
+		.vsync_end = 2400 + 2196 + 2,
+		.vtotal = 2400 + 2196 + 2 + 52,
+	},
 	{
 		/* 30Hz */
 		.clock = (3392 + 100 + 64 + 104) * (2400 + 8126 + 2 + 272) * 30 / 1000,
